Preorder check:
```python
def transitive_closure(n, rel):
    # rel: set of pairs
    reach = {(i,j) for i in range(n) for j in range(n) if (i,j) in rel}
    changed=True
    while changed:
        changed=False
        for a,b in list(reach):
            for c,d in list(reach):
                if b==c and (a,d) not in reach:
                    reach.add((a,d)); changed=True
    return reach
```
